x=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Appointments</span></li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack prose\" style=\"--flow:1rem\" data-reveal=\"right\">\n        <h3 class=\"mt-0\">How this route is built</h3>\n        <p>Our e-commerce & retail route combines national and international newswires with sector trade press, regional desks in the metros that matter to you, and the AI answer engines that handle industry questions. You choose the tier; we handle the routing.</p>\n        <p>Reviews are handled by editors who work this beat, which matters most when a claim needs qualifying or a number needs a source.</p>\n        <p><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"distribution.html\">How distribution routing works <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.25rem);border-radius:var(--r-xl)\" data-reveal>\n      \n<div class=\"callout callout-takeaways\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Key takeaways</strong>\n  <ul><li>Median first pickup for e-commerce & retail releases: 38 minutes on priority plans.</li><li>1,900+ sector-relevant outlets, plus AI answer engines on every plan.</li><li>Specialist editorial review — not a generic queue.</li><li>Metro and country-level targeting included at no extra cost.</li></ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"split\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\" data-reveal>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Answers</p>\n        <h2>E-commerce & Retail distribution questions</h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-3 muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Still stuck? <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Talk to a specialist <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-list\" data-accordion=\"single\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">What makes a retail opening newsworthy?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Numbers — jobs created, square footage, investment, or a first of its kind in a market. A store opening with no figures is a local notice, not news.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Can you target local press for store openings?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes, and this is the highest-return use of the retail route. Metro-level targeting around each opening typically outperforms a national send.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do you distribute DTC brand news?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes, including funding, category reports and sustainability programmes, to consumer and retail trade media.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">How do you handle seasonal timing?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Schedule against the retail calendar. Christmas campaigns sent in December are already late; trade desks plan them in July.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Related industries</p>\n      <h2>Other sectors we cover</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\"><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"technology.html\" data-reveal><h3>Technology</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">11,400+ tech desks and newsletters in network</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"saas.html\" data-reveal><h3>SaaS & B2B Software</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">3,900+ B2B review sites and analyst blogs in network</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"finance.html\" data-reveal><h3>Finance & Banking</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Terminal and analyst-desk delivery across 41 markets</p></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Send your next e-commerce & retail announcement to the desks that cover it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Editorial review, sector targeting, monitoring and AI visibility reporting included.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a